      "claim": "L5 bidirectional transport records for lorcaserin and loratadine show high Papp with efflux ratios ~1.0-1.2, indicating no significant gut-wall efflux for similar lipophilic basic chloroarenes; domperidone and linezolid also show high permeability.",
      "card_ids": ["C137","C150","C164","C179","C156","C133","C138","C131","C153","C146"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "L5 contains some efflux examples (GV196771 as BCRP substrate, AFN-1252 ER ~1.8, compound 1a ER 5), but none involves the query or its close thiourea scaffold; mechanism alone is not affirmative evidence of F < 20%.",
